{"id":595,"date":"2018-09-05T23:19:57","date_gmt":"2018-09-05T23:19:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/agilewriter.wordpress.com\/?p=595"},"modified":"2021-02-03T04:45:39","modified_gmt":"2021-02-03T04:45:39","slug":"agile-writer-starts-alopecia-blog-vlog","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/2018\/09\/05\/agile-writer-starts-alopecia-blog-vlog\/","title":{"rendered":"Agile Writer Starts Alopecia Blog\/Vlog"},"content":{"rendered":"<div>\n<div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"  wp-image-600 alignright\" src=\"https:\/\/agilewriter.files.wordpress.com\/2018\/09\/screen-shot-2018-09-05-at-7-26-56-pm.png\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2018-09-05 at 7.26.56 PM\" width=\"235\" height=\"244\" srcset=\"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/screen-shot-2018-09-05-at-7-26-56-pm.png 385w, https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/screen-shot-2018-09-05-at-7-26-56-pm-289x300.png 289w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 235px) 100vw, 235px\" \/>Christine Gauthier Writes&#8230;<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>In honor of Alopecia Awareness Month, my Alopecian Life YouTube channel goes live on September 1st!<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>Some of you may know that I&#8217;ve been writing a book, a fictionalized account about my experiences living with alopecia.&nbsp; The process has occupied three years of my Sundays, and a lot of emotional and mental energy.&nbsp; While I work at finding an agent and getting published, I&#8217;ve developed a YouTube channel called Alopecian Life where alopecians, and those who love and care for them, can go for support, information, and advice.&nbsp; Please follow\/subscribe to the channel, sign up for my mailing list at<span class=\"m_8327330744017135934gmail-Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/meet.meetup.com\/wf\/click?upn=1CL8KZerddx3RoN8GG8tCtyyzuqk2-2FULaOLK4lUMf4c7YVzVJVLLPlKgLd9KgQet_1SadHgt7HJWF0jsQDdY5-2F0mvz-2BMG